    "Id": "mechdef_surtur_SUR-T1",
    "Name": "Surtur SUR-T1",
    "Details": "The Surtur is a close range attacker, so engineers fitted the design with an extra light fusion engine to push the 'Mech to 90 km/h, with added supercharger for additional temporary boost in speed to 120 km/h. The 'Mech's armor protection includes twelve tons of standard armor to help survive an onslaught of longer range fire so it can intercept its target. Its firepower includes two standard side torso mounted 6-tubed Short-Range Missile Launchers with 1 ton of ammunition feeding from center torso. Energy weapons include seven Flamers, three found in the side torsos and single flamer in left arm. Its signature melee weapon mounted in the right arm is a sword.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Accurate Weapon - HandHeld</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.05</color></b>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_surtur"
  },
